id: MOD18-3
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: module_path_overlap
target: crates/core/src/effect.rs
find:     let before = run.world.insert(p.path.clone(), new.clone());
replace:     let before = run.world.get(&p.path).cloned(); if before.is_none() { run.world.insert(p.path.clone(), new.clone()); }
expect-fail: mod18_same_path_is_overwritten_by_the_later_instance
note: put が既にある要素を置き換えない（同じ経路は後の実体ではなく先の実体の値が残る）
